'''Lovestruck Lesser Demon''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day]] event. It was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] and is a variant of [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lesser Demon Cat]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 648
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Lovestruck Lesser Demon
|name2 = Lovestruck Greater Demon
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Lovestruck Greater Demon''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Lovestruck Lesser Demon has excellent damage and health, as well as the ability to debuff enemies in all sorts of ways, making him excellent against any foe he can pick out. The general idea is to not use him unless the enemy is both not covered by peons all the time and either outranged ([[Bore]] variants)  or lacking in DPS ([[Sunfish Jones]] variants). Although he lacks a [[True Form]], his other forms are a direct upgrade over [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Demon Cat]], making his usage very similar. However, the lack of a True Form is not to be overlooked, as it means that Lovestruck Greater Demon is expected to be easily overwhelmed in the late game, as winning the power game becomes exponentially harder.

It's also expected that the various debuffs he gives are somewhat inconsistent due to the lack of Area Attack, long cooldown for a debuffer and the effects given can also be harmful at times. Only use him when any effect activating would be beneficial to your current situation, otherwise you might risk a [[Knockback]] activating at an inopportune moment. Despite his high damage and DPS as a Greater Demon Cat variant, it's better to play into his strengths whenever possible.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & Crowd-Controller}}

